WEBVTT

00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:15.080
Okay, that's 60 million lir on Figa--

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:16.910
Are you <i>nuts</i> ?!

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:21.830
You stay right there while I teach you
a lesson on the value of money!

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:24.750
Sure feels like you already did.

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:26.200
Pity.

00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:30.830
All that money, right down the drain.

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:37.040
A 1.2x payout on Figaro, eh?
They really aren't taking me seriously.

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:41.410
What bloodlust!

00:00:41.410 --> 00:00:43.370
I-Is she...?

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:45.540
Nemesis!

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:46.750
On it!

00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:55.540
Oh? Looking for a fight, eh?

00:00:55.540 --> 00:00:57.200
--Count--
--Too slow!

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:00.660
Whoa there, grizz!

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:02.950
And who are <i>you</i> ?

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:09.120
Just your average passerbear, grizz.

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:43.500
Hmm. You look powerful.

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:46.600
"Chapter 8: Clash 
of the Superiors"

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:47.250
Who, me? I'm just
a costume fanatic, grizz!

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:50.290
Nice one!

00:02:52.950 --> 00:02:58.410
Isn't that something! You deflected it
even though you're far slower than I.

00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:01.080
Maybe it was worth visiting
this dying nation after all.

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:04.410
If Figaro is a bust, at least I can fight <i>you</i> .

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:07.290
Yeah, that's not happening.

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:09.620
He's going to beat you.

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:14.660
If you're so sure, you must be Figaro.
This ought to be good.

00:03:15.910 --> 00:03:17.200
Wait!

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:19.250
What are you going to do with her?

00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:21.370
"Her"?

00:03:21.370 --> 00:03:23.120
Oh, this.

00:03:23.120 --> 00:03:25.620
She is my companion.

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:31.700
Wait. Did you seriously come after me
because you thought I'd kidnapped her?

00:03:35.950 --> 00:03:41.450
You're a funny one! <i>That's</i> why you laid into me?

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:45.870
I like you. Let's play sometime.

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:49.870
Huh? That voice...

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:53.790
Enough, ambassador. Wake up already.

00:03:53.790 --> 00:04:01.870
Huh? What...? No! No more supersonic air travel!

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:08.540
Hey, that was a close one, grizz!

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:12.790
It's still too early for you to face
a Superior head-on, grizz.

00:04:12.790 --> 00:04:15.790
A Superior? So that was...

00:04:15.790 --> 00:04:20.620
Yep--one of the four greatest players of
the Huang He Empire, the land of hermits:

00:04:20.620 --> 00:04:24.660
Xunyu, the Yinglong, of the Huang He Si Ling.

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:30.060
Hi, everyone!

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:32.120
'Scuse us, grizz.

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:35.410
Um, Ray?

00:04:35.410 --> 00:04:37.290
Who's that... bear... person?

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:41.200
Oh, that's my big brother.
We just happened to be in the same box.

00:04:41.200 --> 00:04:45.330
They're so alike. It's not fur--that's just
a suit. But the texture's the same.

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:47.540
Even the voice is similar... Plus, he's a bear!

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:50.950
Hmm? Is something wrong, Marie?

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:54.250
N-N-N-Nothing! Nothing at all!

00:04:54.250 --> 00:04:56.250
Don't tell me...

00:04:57.700 --> 00:05:00.080
Are you afraid of bears?

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:03.950
Th-Th-Th-That's right! I am!
Afraid, that is! Of bears!

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:07.580
I'm not afraid of your brother, <i>that's</i> for sure!

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:14.660
Time for proper introductions.
Inside this costume is my older brother.

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:16.500
Name's Shu, grizz!

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:17.330
And I'm Rook.

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:18.330
I'm Babi!

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:23.620
I-I'm Marie Adler. Pleased to...

00:05:23.620 --> 00:05:27.620
Hmm. Marie Adler?

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:30.830
Don't tell me...

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:32.330
Gulp.

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:35.620
Is your job Journalist?

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:38.830
Huh? Th-That's right.

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:41.910
I read that manga, too!

00:05:41.910 --> 00:05:42.870
Which manga?

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:45.330
<i>Into the Shadow</i> .

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:51.040
The protagonist is a journalist
named Marie Adler.

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:52.500
Huh!

00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:57.080
It ended after only one part, but I liked it--

00:05:57.080 --> 00:06:00.700
I've been waiting for it to start up again.

00:06:00.700 --> 00:06:03.500
Why, thank you!

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:07.750
Now for our main event!

00:06:07.750 --> 00:06:12.790
The Clash of the Superiors is about to begin!

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:18.450
First, to the east: Hailing all the way
from Huang He in the far east,

00:06:18.450 --> 00:06:22.870
the great Superior martial artist
known as the Yinglong!

00:06:22.870 --> 00:06:28.160
The Master Jiangshi: Xinyu!

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:32.870
What kind of job is "Master Jiangshi"?

00:06:32.870 --> 00:06:38.540
There's this "Daoshi" job in Huang He;
this is the Superior Job version of that.

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:45.410
And to the west: The pride of Gideon!
The king! The solitary explorer!

00:06:45.410 --> 00:06:51.830
The mightiest man, bearing the titles
Endless Chain and Over Gladiator!

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:54.750
Figaro!

00:06:57.700 --> 00:07:04.700
Fi-ga-ro! Fi-ga-ro! Fi-ga-ro! Fi-ga-ro...!

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:07.950
Yes, folks, this is going to be
the fight of the century!

00:07:07.950 --> 00:07:10.750
But first, let's review what's not allowed.

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:17.040
Items that nullify instadeath damage
and consumable healing items are a no-no.

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:20.790
Equipped skills, however, are exempt.

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:24.450
Figgy'd really have the upper hand
if those things were allowed.

00:07:24.450 --> 00:07:27.250
If the rules are the same for both,
would it matter?

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:30.290
With Figgy, it would.

00:07:33.040 --> 00:07:36.330
The barrier is in place!

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:37.910
What's this?

00:07:37.910 --> 00:07:42.080
Hello? Can you hear me?

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:47.580
Allow me to make a declaration
that should help fire things up:

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:52.790
I will not move a single step in this
bout until Figaro is on his knees.

00:07:52.790 --> 00:07:54.250
Are you serious?!

00:07:54.250 --> 00:07:55.950
Who do you think he is?

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:58.330
Go to hell!

00:07:58.330 --> 00:08:02.120
Excellent. Instant bad guy!

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:10.040
And with that, it's time for the main event:
The Clash of the Superiors!

00:08:10.040 --> 00:08:13.250
Begin!

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:20.700
It's too fast!

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:23.290
They got the barrier settings wrong.

00:08:23.290 --> 00:08:24.830
Settings?

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:31.000
The barrier here slows down the action
inside it so it's easier to follow.

00:08:33.160 --> 00:08:36.200
But it's still too fast.

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:41.290
And for the audience's safety,
there are actually five barriers in place.

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:45.870
Since attacks from players at level 50
and below pass right through,

00:08:45.870 --> 00:08:48.700
they can't take part in duels.

00:08:48.700 --> 00:08:52.370
Now adjusting the speed.

00:08:58.950 --> 00:09:02.160
Figaro's entirely on the defensive.

00:09:02.160 --> 00:09:05.200
So this is a Superior who's made for speed...

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:08.620
The Jiangshi hasn't used any magic yet.

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:30.250
His own attacks are hitting his arms,
but dealing hardly any damage.

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:34.500
Those arms must be his Superior Embryo.

00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:39.290
Its characteristic ability?
Tough arms reaching far at high speed.

00:09:42.830 --> 00:09:45.660
Call: Baolei!

00:09:52.910 --> 00:09:57.040
Zhenhuo Zhendeng... Baolongba!

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:11.830
He blocked that--with zero damage?!

00:10:11.830 --> 00:10:13.870
Was that an Embryo skill?

00:10:13.870 --> 00:10:15.830
No, an equipment skill.

00:10:15.830 --> 00:10:18.870
That Special Reward cloak he always wears--

00:10:18.870 --> 00:10:22.830
it can block all outside interference,
if only for a short time.

00:10:22.830 --> 00:10:30.540
But it has a ten-minute cooldown...
which means he just played his ace in the hole.

00:10:30.540 --> 00:10:34.330
But so did the other guy, right?

00:10:34.330 --> 00:10:38.950
Magic that uses that many Fu must be
tough to pull off a second time.

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:45.870
Now we just have to figure out
what effect Xunyu's other skill had.

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:50.200
"Tenaga Ashinaga"...
That's what I saw him whisper.

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:53.040
Figaro's defense skill is wearing off!

00:10:58.080 --> 00:11:01.120
I seem to have missed your heart.

00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:03.910
This is a damn lung!

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:18.080
So that's what came of Xunyu's groundwork...

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:19.200
Groundwork?

00:11:19.200 --> 00:11:24.120
Right. First he said he wouldn't move
a single step, so it wouldn't seem weird

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:29.410
that he wasn't using the legs
hidden in those long trousers.

00:11:29.410 --> 00:11:34.370
The Fu and the Elemental were setting
the stage for that big magic blast.

00:11:34.370 --> 00:11:39.750
Right. Baolei and Zhenhuo
Zhendeng Baolongba, was it?

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:40.910
All that power...

00:11:40.910 --> 00:11:46.160
They may have been Xunyu's trump cards,
but even so, he used them to try to stop Figaro.

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:47.660
Exactly.

00:11:47.660 --> 00:11:52.950
Most powerful omnidirectional defense skills
don't let you move while in use.

00:11:52.950 --> 00:11:55.160
Not even to use other skills.

00:11:55.160 --> 00:11:56.450
Wait a second.

00:11:56.450 --> 00:12:00.830
If Figaro's Special Reward gear completely
blocked damage from every direction,

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:02.910
no attacks should have reached him.

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:06.080
No attacks from the <i>outside</i> , that is.

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:10.370
You must know what that
ultimate skill really does, then.

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:13.160
Looks like you've got a
pretty good idea yourself.

00:12:13.160 --> 00:12:15.290
Based on circumstantial evidence, though.

00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:18.700
What kind of attack could
cause such grave damage?

00:12:18.700 --> 00:12:24.040
Figgy lost an organ, right?
But there's not a scratch on him.

00:12:24.040 --> 00:12:29.540
An ultimate skill is the culmination of an
Embryo's unique characteristics, which means...

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:33.660
Oh, right! Its characteristics
are speed and range.

00:12:33.660 --> 00:12:35.750
And the culmination of those would be...

00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:37.410
Warping.

00:12:37.410 --> 00:12:44.160
That's meant to be a super-long-distance skill.
You must have really prepared for that.

00:12:44.160 --> 00:12:47.160
It's what I do.

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:49.830
Why aren't they moving?

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:52.620
Is it a side effect of the skill?

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:55.160
No, that's just Xunyu being cautious.

00:12:55.160 --> 00:12:56.330
Cautious?

00:12:56.330 --> 00:13:01.830
Figaro's trump card is that he's never
shown off his Superior Embryo.

00:13:01.830 --> 00:13:04.200
Still hasn't used it today, in fact.

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:07.790
No--he's been using it all this time.

00:13:07.790 --> 00:13:08.830
Huh?

00:13:08.830 --> 00:13:11.080
"All this time"--since when?

00:13:11.080 --> 00:13:13.540
Since the start of the match.

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:16.410
Is his Embryo a piece of equipment he's wearing?

00:13:16.410 --> 00:13:23.120
It can't be. I've been using my Identification
skill constantly--his gear is all items.

00:13:29.330 --> 00:13:33.500
Was it <i>that</i> hard to breathe?

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:35.870
Let's finish this!

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:44.660
That's the same attack and block as before.

00:13:44.660 --> 00:13:48.620
The same? Even with only one lung?

00:13:51.950 --> 00:13:55.830
Physical Berserk! He's using that <i>here</i> ?!

00:13:55.830 --> 00:13:59.790
Nice face you're making, Figaro!

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:12.580
What have you done?

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:13.580
No way...

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:14.950
What happened?

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:17.620
Nemesis, what do Figaro's
equipment slots look like?

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:22.080
For the gladiator grouping?
Some skills can increase the number of slots,

00:14:22.080 --> 00:14:27.080
but I'd say he has about
25 pieces of gear equipped.

00:14:27.080 --> 00:14:27.870
Bro!

00:14:27.870 --> 00:14:28.950
What's up, grizz?

00:14:28.950 --> 00:14:32.450
What kind of gear does Figaro have equipped?

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:36.660
I believe it's stuff to boost
his strength and agility.

00:14:36.660 --> 00:14:38.790
Is it, now...

00:14:39.910 --> 00:14:42.080
He's even stronger!

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:47.290
It's against all logic. Who gets stronger
by taking their equipment <i>off</i> ?

00:14:47.290 --> 00:14:49.370
Taking their equipment off...

00:14:49.370 --> 00:14:50.290
Bro!

00:14:50.290 --> 00:14:51.370
Yessir?

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:58.040
Figaro's Embryo makes his weapon mightier
the fewer pieces of gear he has equipped.

00:14:58.040 --> 00:14:58.870
Am I right?

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:00.370
What makes you think that?

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:05.080
That's all I <i>can</i> think of, with him getting
stronger as he takes off his gear.

00:15:05.080 --> 00:15:06.950
That's your only evidence?

00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:12.830
That, and the fact that you can't normally
explore the Tomb Labyrinth solo, like he did.

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:16.120
Surely with a Superior Embryo, you can, grizz.

00:15:16.120 --> 00:15:21.660
If that's all it takes, there'd be others.
But no--only Figaro.

00:15:21.660 --> 00:15:24.250
There's something about <i>him</i>
that makes it possible.

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:25.370
Which is?

00:15:25.370 --> 00:15:27.410
Utility and countermeasures.

00:15:27.410 --> 00:15:30.500
He starts out fully equipped
so he can take anyone on,

00:15:30.500 --> 00:15:34.660
and powers up mid-battle by leaving on
only what works best against that foe.

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:36.660
You're half right.

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:41.660
His equipment's starting stats
are doubled when he's in full gear.

00:15:41.660 --> 00:15:42.620
Doubled?!

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:46.000
You didn't say <i>these</i> are
the starting stats, though.

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:49.790
Right. The other part of
his Embryo's unique trait?

00:15:49.790 --> 00:15:52.160
Those stats rise in proportion to battle time.

00:15:52.160 --> 00:15:56.450
The longer the fight, the more powerful
he gets--and there's no ceiling.

00:15:56.450 --> 00:15:58.910
So <i>that's</i> why he's the Endless Chain.

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:05.410
Hah! Outstanding, Figaro!

00:16:09.120 --> 00:16:11.040
Damn--I blew it!

00:16:11.040 --> 00:16:15.580
I should have aimed at your head,
even at the risk of you dodging!

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:27.790
That weapon! Figaro's going in for the kill!

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:32.580
Do you know what that weapon is?
Identification isn't working.

00:16:32.580 --> 00:16:34.580
A Superior Item:

00:16:34.580 --> 00:16:38.160
The Zenith Dragon's Brilliant Fang, Gloria α.

00:16:38.160 --> 00:16:40.660
What? You mean...

00:16:40.660 --> 00:16:42.750
It's on a whole other level.

00:16:45.830 --> 00:16:48.540
Then I guess I'll use <i>this</i> !

00:16:49.950 --> 00:16:55.500
Yinglong's Fang, Suling Yi:
A Superior Item, just like yours.

00:16:55.500 --> 00:17:00.790
It's no match for you--one bump
and your stats'll skyrocket--

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:05.370
but it grows stronger
the more MP and SP I give it.

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:08.790
I'm putting everything I have
into this next blow.

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:11.000
It will be your last!

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:45.410
Gotcha!

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:51.750
Huh?! Where'd that claw come from?

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:56.330
That bluster about giving it his all--
it was a setup for that surprise attack!

00:17:56.330 --> 00:17:57.370
Figaro lost...

00:17:57.370 --> 00:17:59.080
No--

00:17:59.080 --> 00:18:01.870
His Embryo'll see him through.

00:18:01.870 --> 00:18:04.830
What?! Why isn't it piercing you?

00:18:04.830 --> 00:18:07.160
His Embryo...

00:18:08.370 --> 00:18:11.660
...is a heart-shaped Superior Embryo.

00:18:12.620 --> 00:18:14.500
A heart-shaped--

00:18:14.500 --> 00:18:16.870
Embryo?!

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:24.410
Thank you. You were a wonderful opponent.

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:29.620
Fang of Gloria!

00:18:35.830 --> 00:18:38.330
Overdrive!

00:18:58.620 --> 00:19:03.830
We have a winner! Figaro!

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:09.660
What a great match!

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:12.080
Yes, it really was something.

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:15.950
The best I've ever seen!

00:19:15.950 --> 00:19:18.370
Certainly worth crossing the desert for.

00:19:18.370 --> 00:19:22.830
Ooh, you came all the way from Caldina?

00:19:22.830 --> 00:19:27.410
Yes, and I'll return with a fine story to tell.

00:19:27.410 --> 00:19:28.790
Hmm?

00:19:28.790 --> 00:19:31.410
Ah, it's starting.

00:19:31.410 --> 00:19:33.000
spec

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:36.830
Very well--we'll continue to spectate, then.

00:19:36.830 --> 00:19:39.450
Another show is about to begin.

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:47.870
What's going on, Bro...?

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:49.160
Bro?

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:54.700
Some idiot's gone and
stopped time within the barrier.

00:19:54.700 --> 00:19:57.040
There's something up there!

00:19:59.200 --> 00:20:00.790
That's...

00:20:00.790 --> 00:20:02.700
Dr. Flamingo?

00:20:02.700 --> 00:20:06.500
Hello and good evening, ladies and gents!

00:20:06.500 --> 00:20:08.620
What a battle, am I right?

00:20:08.620 --> 00:20:13.500
Normally there'd be some old fancypants
talking your ear off right about now,

00:20:13.500 --> 00:20:17.000
but let's skip that snoozefest
and do something fun instead!

00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:21.830
Who are you? Why would you
sully this fine event?!

00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:29.750
Who am I? Oh, all right--I guess I'll tell you.

00:20:29.750 --> 00:20:34.950
Here you go: Check out <i>this</i> handsome mug!

00:20:34.950 --> 00:20:38.160
Why, you're... you're...

00:20:40.120 --> 00:20:46.450
Dear, dear! All these people
know about little old me?

00:20:46.450 --> 00:20:51.040
What are you doing here, Mr. Franklin?

00:20:51.040 --> 00:20:55.870
And you are cor- <i>rect</i> !

00:20:55.870 --> 00:21:03.450
Yes, I'm the one who made monster
fodder of your king and his pals!

00:21:03.450 --> 00:21:09.620
A Superior from the Dryfe Imperium!
Mr. Franklin, the Giga Professor!

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:11.580
A Superior...

00:21:23.080 --> 00:21:29.120
Lotta hotheads here in the ol'
Duel City. So quick to judge!

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:34.700
But you probably don't want
to go to gaol, do you?

00:21:37.870 --> 00:21:40.290
Now watch this!

00:21:44.290 --> 00:21:45.700
Ellie!

00:21:45.700 --> 00:21:49.660
The second princess, Elizabeth S. Altar.

00:21:49.660 --> 00:21:51.950
Do you see what I'm getting at?

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:56.290
Assassinating a royal gets
you sent straight to gaol.

00:22:08.000 --> 00:22:10.330
Now, then!

00:22:10.330 --> 00:22:12.870
Let's play a game, shall we?

00:23:44.440 --> 00:23:48.400
"The Beginning of Madness"

00:23:45.500 --> 00:23:48.330
"The Beginning of Madness."
